  - '((8-7) + (6 - 5)) - (( 4 - 3) + ( 2 -1)) +1 '
  - Keypad Digit Error
  - "\u201CThe number you need was imprinted on me.\\n\\nIts supposed to tell you
    what I am. \\n\\nWho I am. \\n\\n It happened so long ago but I am still here.
    \\n\\n I still stand out, just like what you need to see\u201D"
  - '"Which number has the same number of letters as its value"'
  TimerInterval: 7
  gameStateManager: {fileID: 0}
  ClueText: {fileID: 2613016866891390459}
